        "created_at": "2013-06-28T15:41:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>See what I did there? No, not yet? Read on.</p><p>Maybe I've been reading too many back-issues of comics and watching too much Deep Space Nine, but has anyone wondered what's going on with political authority figures in SotM? You don't really see much more than an errant, nearly-impotent policeman. And I have a theory.</p><p>Government does nothing because government is an agent of an enemy. Skinjobs or shapeshifters, our planet has been infiltrated. And it's only a matter of time before it comes to a head.</p><p>FILTER may catch a small piece of the puzzle, not knowing it's a piece of something larger. Or perhaps they're in on it, locking up those who've figured it out.</p><p>Or maybe. Just maybe. Maybe Mr. Fixer or Wraith over there is one of them.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
