      {
        "id": 66692,
        "name": "Ironic",
        "username": "Ironic",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-28T19:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If there is an evil government conspiracy, why would you not assume that F.I.L.T.E.R. is at the heart of it? &nbsp;Mock Police Backup if you must, but they at least target bad guys exclusively -&nbsp; F.I.L.T.E.R. is more than willing to take down heroes.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Braithwhite\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/48/1854_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Braithwhite:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That's debateable. &nbsp;You can explode in several elevators, though they are semi-obscured by the snow. &nbsp;The masks are flimsy and illegal, unless Legacy eats waffles. &nbsp;Knight takes checkers and the whole tablecloth unravels. &nbsp;I'm not sure I believe any of it.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Of course! &nbsp;Now it all makes sense.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:44:28.831Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
