        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "If there is an evil government conspiracy, why would you not assume that F.I.L.T.E.R. is at the heart of it? &nbsp;Mock Police Backup if you must, but they at least target bad guys exclusively -&nbsp; F.I.L.T.E.R. is more than willing to take down heroes. \n\n \n[quote=\"Braithwhite\"]\n \n\nThat&#39;s debateable. &nbsp;You can explode in several elevators, though they are semi-obscured by the snow. &nbsp;The masks are flimsy and illegal, unless Legacy eats waffles. &nbsp;Knight takes checkers and the whole tablecloth unravels. &nbsp;I&#39;m not sure I believe any of it.&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nOf course! &nbsp;Now it all makes sense.\n",
